From: Hariharan <14965074+cvhariharan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:52:55 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat: make the terms of use and privacy policy links optional

Clear a blank TermsOfServiceLink instead of resetting it to Mattermost's
terms, as upstream already does for PrivacyPolicyLink. Show the sign-up
agreement checkbox only when a policy link is configured, naming only the
links that are, and don't require it otherwise.

Mattermax-Patch: optional-policy-links.patch
---
